{
  "name" : "Evans2004 - Cell based mathematical model of topotecan",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">     <p>A two compartment mathematical model of the antineoplastic compound topotecan</p>  </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
